<title>INDIA: India announces 20 bln rupee 3-year stock auction.</title>
<headline>India announces 20 bln rupee 3-year stock auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it would conduct a 20 billion rupee auction of three-year government of India dated securities on December 23.</p>
<p>The results of the auction will be announced on the same day and payment by successful bidders will be during banking hours on December 24, the RBI said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new stock would qualify for the ready-forward facility.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
